# Wine/Acrobat PostScript contains an embedded Adobe block, which CUPS
# classifies as application/vnd.adobe-reader-postscript. Without a direct
# rule that type is forced through pstops -> gstoraster -> rastertopwg ->
# pwgtopdf and the job dies in Ghostscript. Retype it as plain PostScript so
# the normal gstopdf path is used.
#
# Ported from konica-retrofit (see docs-Wine-Adobe-PS-Fix.md there).
application/vnd.adobe-reader-postscript application/postscript 0 -
